{"4921030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Splimbo City", "steam_appid": 4921030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Splimbo City, fight clubs are legal and you came to become the best fighter there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splimbo City was created by billionaire Michael Splimbo to be a city of fight clubs, but there are darker secrets underneath it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live a Double Life</strong><br>Balance the grind of day to day work or fight everyone in the city to level up your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Your Way Up</strong><br>Battle in a turn-based combat system with a full leveling and ability progression. Unlock moves like Dodge, Counter, Heavy Punch, Headbutt, and more. Battle tougher and tougher enemies or pick on the little guys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an Open World</strong><br>Explore several districts that all have different stuff to do. Fish and live off the land down in Splimbo Lake, explore suburban life in South Splimbo, or live among the grimy chaos of North Splimbo and other districts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Life (or Ruin It)</strong><br>Manage your inventory and equipment, upgrade your apartment, and earn money through jobs and side hustles, all while a karma system tracks the consequences, from petty crime to becoming a menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong><br>Nothing in Splimbo City is what it seems. Fight your way through the underground scene and start pulling threads that connect it all to something much bigger and darker.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Splimbo City, fight clubs are legal and you came to become the best fighter there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Splimbo City was created by billionaire Michael Splimbo to be a city of fight clubs, but there are darker secrets underneath it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live a Double Life</strong><br>Balance the grind of day to day work or fight everyone in the city to level up your skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Your Way Up</strong><br>Battle in a turn-based combat system with a full leveling and ability progression. Unlock moves like Dodge, Counter, Heavy Punch, Headbutt, and more. Battle tougher and tougher enemies or pick on the little guys.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an Open World</strong><br>Explore several districts that all have different stuff to do. Fish and live off the land down in Splimbo Lake, explore suburban life in South Splimbo, or live among the grimy chaos of North Splimbo and other districts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Life (or Ruin It)</strong><br>Manage your inventory and equipment, upgrade your apartment, and earn money through jobs and side hustles, all while a karma system tracks the consequences, from petty crime to becoming a menace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Truth</strong><br>Nothing in Splimbo City is what it seems. Fight your way through the underground scene and start pulling threads that connect it all to something much bigger and darker.</p>", "short_description": "In Splimbo City, fight clubs are legal and you came to become the best fighter there.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4921030/de38cf2be888253839f77fa7f8767fc02e807db9/header.jpg?t=1786629383", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4921030/dcfda76fdc05f0ed9f199fdd7b23cc566a359aee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786629383", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4921030/dcfda76fdc05f0ed9f199fdd7b23cc566a359aee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786629383", "website": null,